"Ausprobieren auf dem eigenen Rechner gehört DEBUG=True in die server/.env."
msgstr ""
"DEBUG is off, which is how a server in operation runs. The demo creates "
"accounts with the password from DEMO.md, and whoever knows it signs in with "
"it.\n"
"If this server is to show nothing but the demo, use --demo-server. For "
"trying it out on your own machine, DEBUG=True belongs in server/.env."

