"One inventory created with %(positionen)s count lines: %(haeuser)s. You are "
"counting too. Whoever else counts is assigned on the inventory. Without an "
"entry nobody sees the inventory in the counting app."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(anzahl)s inventories created with %(positionen)s count lines in total: "
"%(haeuser)s. You are counting too. Whoever else counts is assigned per "
"inventory. Without an entry nobody sees the inventory in the counting app."

