"der Leiste, das Bild im Browsertab und die Icons für den Startbildschirm. "
"Leer lassen ändert am vorhandenen Logo nichts."
msgstr ""
"A square PNG, at least 512 x 512 pixels. The logo of the bar, the image in "
"the browser tab and the icons for the home screen are derived from it. "
"Leaving it empty changes nothing about the existing logo."

