"Dafür braucht es einen Browser mit Passkeys und eine sichere Verbindung "
"(HTTPS)."
msgstr "This needs a browser with passkeys and a secure connection (HTTPS)."

#: templates/accounts/email_change.html:46
msgid "Mail schicken"
msgstr "Send mail"

#: templates/accounts/email_change.html:46
msgid "Adresse ändern"
msgstr "Change address"

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:15
msgid "Mail unterwegs"
msgstr "Mail on its way"

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An <strong>%(email)s</strong> ist eine Mail mit einem Link unterwegs. Erst "
"wenn du ihn bestätigt hast, gilt die neue Adresse. Bis dahin bleibt die "
"bisherige."
msgstr ""
"A mail with a link is on its way to <strong>%(email)s</strong>. The new "
"address applies once you have confirmed it. Until then the previous one "
"stays."

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:18
#, python-format
msgid "Der Link gilt einen Tag."
msgid_plural "Der Link gilt %(tage)s Tage."
msgstr[0] "The link lasts one day."
msgstr[1] "The link lasts %(tage)s days."

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:21
msgid "Adresse geändert"
msgstr "Address changed"

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:23
#, python-format
msgid "Deine Adresse ist jetzt <strong>%(email)s</strong>."
msgstr "Your address is now <strong>%(email)s</strong>."

#: templates/accounts/email_change_done.html:31
#: templates/accounts/email_confirm_done.html:24
#: templates/accounts/invitation_done.html:20
#: templates/accounts/no_access.html:23
