"Soll <strong>%(email)s</strong> die Adresse des Kontos <strong>%(username)s</"
"strong> werden?"
msgstr ""
"Should <strong>%(email)s</strong> become the address of the account "
"<strong>%(username)s</strong>?"

#: templates/accounts/email_confirm.html:22
msgid "Ja, Adresse übernehmen"
msgstr "Yes, take over the address"

#: templates/accounts/email_confirm.html:25
msgid "Adresse schon vergeben"
msgstr "Address already taken"

#: templates/accounts/email_confirm.html:27
msgid ""
"Diese Adresse gehört inzwischen zu einem anderen Konto. Trag eine andere "
"ein, oder sprich mit einem Administrator."
msgstr ""
"This address now belongs to another account. Enter a different one, or talk "
"to an administrator."

#: templates/accounts/email_confirm.html:29
#: templates/accounts/email_confirm.html:35
#: templates/accounts/invitation.html:31 templates/admin/backup_done.html:28
#: templates/admin/backup_running.html:24
#: templates/components/error_page.html:25
