msgid ""
"%(name)s führt noch keine Hausartikel. Entweder einzeln anlegen oder den "
"Artikelstamm einlesen."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s carries no articles yet. Either create them one by one or import "
"the article master."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:21
msgid ""
"Aus „Nicht zählbar“ herausnehmen. Familie, Status der Hausartikel und ihre "
"Plätze kommen zurück, soweit sie gemerkt sind."
msgstr ""
"Take out of “Not countable”. Family, status of the articles and their places "
"come back, as far as they were remembered."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:22
#, python-format
msgid ""
"„%(name)s“ wieder als Ware führen? Familie und Status der Hausartikel kommen "
"zurück, ihre Plätze in den Zähllisten an die alte Stelle, soweit sie gemerkt "
"sind und es sie noch gibt."
msgstr ""
"Carry “%(name)s” as a product again? Family and status of the articles come "
"back, their places in the count lists to their old position, as far as they "
"were remembered and still exist."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:22
msgid "Wieder aufnehmen"
msgstr "Bring back"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:24
#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:22
#, python-format
msgid "Status von %(name)s"
msgstr "Status of %(name)s"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:25
