msgstr "Set “%(name)s” inactive? That affects %(wen)s."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:32
msgid "Alle Hausartikel einstellen"
msgstr "Discontinue all articles"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"„%(name)s“ einstellen? Das trifft %(welche)s. Sie fallen aus den Zähllisten."
msgstr ""
"Discontinue “%(name)s”? That affects %(welche)s. They drop out of the count "
"lists."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:38
#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:36
msgid "Nicht zählbar: Pfand, Gutschein und dergleichen"
msgstr "Not countable: deposits, vouchers and the like"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:48
msgid "alle aktiven Hausartikel dieser Warengruppe"
msgstr "all active articles of this article group"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:49
msgid "alle Hausartikel dieser Warengruppe"
msgstr "all articles of this article group"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:50
msgid ""
"Alle Waren dieser Warengruppe nicht zählbar setzen? Sie kommen in die "
"Familie „Nicht zählbar“, in jedem Haus, auch wo ein anderes Haus dieselbe "
"Ware unter einer anderen Warengruppe führt."
msgstr ""
"Set all products of this article group to not countable? They move into the "
"family “Not countable”, at every site, even where another site carries the "
"same product under a different article group."

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:56
msgid "die aktiven Hausartikel in jedem Haus"
msgstr "the active articles at every site"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:57
msgid "alle Hausartikel in jedem Haus"
msgstr "all articles at every site"

#: templates/katalog/components/sammelstatus_buttons.html:58
msgid ""
"Nicht zählbar? Die Ware kommt in die Familie „Nicht zählbar“, in jedem Haus."
msgstr ""
"Not countable? The product moves into the family “Not countable”, at every "
"site."

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:16
msgid "Die Ware aus „Nicht zählbar“ herausnehmen"
msgstr "Take the product out of “Not countable”"

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:16
msgid "Zur Ware"
msgstr "To the product"

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:23
msgid "Wird geführt und gezählt"
msgstr "Carried and counted"

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:27
msgid "Gerade nicht im Sortiment, kommt wieder (etwa Saisonware)"
msgstr "Not in the range right now, will return (seasonal goods, for instance)"

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:31
msgid "Vorbei: bleibt nur für alte Ergebnisse stehen"
msgstr "Over: kept only for old results"

#: templates/katalog/components/status_buttons.html:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Nicht zählbar? Die Ware „%(name)s“ kommt in die Familie „Nicht zählbar“, in "
"jedem Haus."
msgstr ""
"Not countable? The product “%(name)s” moves into the family “Not countable”, "
"at every site."

#: templates/katalog/components/ware_group.html:8
#, python-format
msgid "%(eintraege)s Waren"
msgstr "%(eintraege)s products"

#: templates/katalog/components/ware_table.html:36
#: templates/katalog/rezepturartikel_detail.html:45
#: templates/katalog/ware_list.html:9
msgid "Geführt in"
msgstr "Carried at"

#: templates/katalog/components/ware_table.html:97
msgid "(inaktiv)"
msgstr "(inactive)"

#: templates/katalog/components/ware_table.html:103
msgid "nirgends mehr"
msgstr "nowhere any more"

#: templates/katalog/components/ware_table.html:105
#: templates/katalog/inventurart_list.html:57
#: templates/katalog/rezepturartikel_detail.html:72
